  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: The hungry beast did not bother to pay attention to its own affairs.
  - speaker: 1
    text: The open mouth of the beast, it was like a gate to hell had opened in front
      of us. What a beautiful sight it was !
  - speaker: 0
    text: You find that... Beautiful ?
  - speaker: 1
    text: Oh yes, indeed ! Such a beautiful red that bloomed everywhere like so many
      poinsettias !
